[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0131","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1389","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。用户从恶意网站复制或拖拽内容到另一个网站时，所选内容中包含的脚本会在目标网站的上下文中执行，导致攻击者可注入任意脚本或 HTML。攻击者需要诱使用户执行粘贴或拖拽操作，属于用户辅助型攻击。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.4~10.6 及 Windows 平台上的 Safari 5.0 及 4.1 之前版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1389"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-11T18:00:20.987","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:15.597","remediation":"建议立即升级 Safari 浏览器：Mac OS X 10.5/10.6 及 Windows 用户升级至 5.0 或更高版本，Mac OS X 10.4 用户升级至 4.1 或更高版本。可通过 Mac App Store 或 Apple 官网下载安装。临时缓解措施：在 Safari 偏好设置中禁用 JavaScript，或避免从不可信网站拖拽/粘贴内容到其他站点。企业环境可通过配置管理工具批量推送更新。升级后验证版本号确保修复生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-01/msg00006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/40105","http://secunia.com/advisories/41856","http://secunia.com/advisories/43068","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024067","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4196","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4225","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:039","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40620","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1006-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1373","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2722","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0212","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0552","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6649","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2010/CVE-2010-1389.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3619c6454232bc86bc1c5ee6d49baecbff394f3b/cves/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1389.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-1389","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-w5p9-mqc9-mq2r/GHSA-w5p9-mqc9-mq2r.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2010-1389","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2010-1389.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_apple_safari_mult_vuln_jun10.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2010-1389.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_112000_112100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0131.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0129","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0129.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1385","title":"Apple Safari PDF处理释放后重用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 在处理 PDF 文档时存在释放后重用（Use-after-free）漏洞，远程攻击者可诱导用户访问恶意网站或打开特制的 PDF 文件触发该漏洞，成功利用后可实现任意代码执行或导致应用程序崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.4 上的 Safari 4.1 之前版本，以及 Mac OS X 10.5~10.6 和 Windows 平台上的 Safari 5.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1385"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-11T18:00:15.957","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:15.010","remediation":"立即升级 Safari 至 5.0 及以上版本（Mac OS X 10.5~10.6 / Windows）或 Safari 4.1 及以上版本（Mac OS X 10.4），该漏洞在处理恶意 PDF 文档时触发释放后重用，可通过 Apple 官网或 Software Update 获取更新。无法升级时，配置 Web 浏览器禁用 PDF 自动打开并在沙箱环境中浏览不可信 PDF 文件作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00000.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/40105","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024067","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4196","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40620","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1373","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A7199","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2010/CVE-2010-1385.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f0e93dd3ef2d8235c938c56855c95925193ef4eb/cves/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1385.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-1385","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/225c6c94f2eea464da1eabd6045f49a9659b6646/2010/CVE-2010-1385.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-1385.json","https://github.com/0xCyberY/CVE-T4PDF/blob/91e0c8080e34fbea79154cd21d1239bd51201f30/README.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_apple_safari_mult_vuln_jun10.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_112000_112100.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/safari_5_0.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0129.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0128","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1384","title":"Apple Safari URL中包含用户名密码的信息泄露钓鱼漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 浏览器在较早版本（Mac OS X 10.4 系统低于 4.1 版本，Mac OS X 10.5 至 10.6 及 Windows 系统低于 5.0 版本）中，未对包含用户名和密码信息的 HTTP 或 HTTPS URL 提供安全警告。攻击者可构造包含嵌入式凭据的恶意 URL，利用浏览器自动填充用户名密码的功能诱骗用户访问看似可信的站点，从而实施钓鱼攻击并窃取用户凭据。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.4、10.5、10.6 及 Windows 平台上的 Safari 4.1/5.0 之前版本，攻击者只需诱导用户点击特制链接即可完成攻击，无需用户交互即可触发凭据泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1384"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-11T18:00:15.910","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:14.877","remediation":"建议立即将 Safari 浏览器升级至 5.0 版本（适用于 Mac OS X 10.5/10.6 及 Windows）或 4.1 版本（适用于 Mac OS X 10.4），以修复 URL 欺骗漏洞。升级后，Safari 会在导航到包含用户名和密码的 HTTP/HTTPS URL 前显示警告。如无法立即升级，应避免点击包含嵌入式认证信息的可疑链接，并手动核实地址栏中的目标地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN46026251/index.html","http://jvndb.jvn.jp/ja/contents/2010/JVNDB-2010-001538.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/40105","http://secunia.com/advisories/42314","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024067","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4196","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4225","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4456","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40620","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1373","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6812","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2010/CVE-2010-1384.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7415a52c8c7c49b12758f6cb68d7d41d1190b12/cves/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-1384","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2010-1384","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03565a27475d500737670f7247b6cadb2e7c3d33/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-1384.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530f