-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-0395.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_fedora_2011_0837_openoffice.org_fc13.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0095","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2259","title":"Tamlyncreative Com Bfsurvey Basic 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! BF Survey (com_bfsurvey) 组件存在路径遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过 index.php 的 controller 参数传入 \"..\" 序列实现目录遍历，进而包含并执行任意本地文件。该漏洞影响 Tamlyncreative Com Bfsurvey Basic 1.1 版本，远程未认证攻击者可利用此漏洞读取敏感文件或实现代码执行，CVSS 评分 7.5，属高危漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2259"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-06-09T20:30:29.663","updated":"2026-06-16T23:20:24.563","remediation":"立即升级 Tamlyncreative BF Survey (com_bfsurvey) 组件至官方修复版本（1.1 之后的安全版本），或直接在 Joomla 后台卸载/禁用该组件以消除风险；若暂无法升级，应修改 index.php 中对 controller 参数的处理逻辑，使用 basename() 过滤并严格限制仅允许白名单内的控制器文件名，拒绝任何包含“../”或 Null 字节的输入；同时在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache 的 .htaccess）对该组件目录配置拒绝访问非预期路径请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/61438","http://packetstormsecurity.org/1001-exploits/joomlabfsurvey-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/37866","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10946","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/37584","http://www.tamlyncreative.com.au/software/forum/index.php?topic=641.0","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10946","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2259.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-2259.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2259.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cd