本（1.1 以上），或从 Joomla! 后台「扩展管理」中卸载/禁用 com_perchaimageattach 组件；若暂无法升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）配置中通过 mod_rewrite 规则拒绝 index.php 的 controller 参数包含「../」序列的请求，作为临时缓解措施，并定期审计站点文件访问日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1005-exploits/joomlaperchaia-lfi.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40244","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/34003","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2034.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-2034.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2034.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5df5af06e079a6824349b336150de94d9ba1e7f8/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2034.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-2034-1903.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/f29605a96fd1261602d83e1b34d001cc853a7340/nvdcve/CVE-2010-2034.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-2034_25.yaml","https://github.com/Ciyfly/woodpecker/blob/f88bed6da55238547a423ce17dccb2cdbc93be50/pocs/nuclei/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2034.yaml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/1bd4b45696a5c61fddcf8f192b354ef64a649205/api/2010/CVE-2010-2034.json","https://github.com/cyb3r-w0lf/nuclei-template-collection/blob/7025ebe04ab60b84aee0af1ecf4f90601332e8e7/nuclei-templates/CVE-2010/cve-2010-2034.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2010-2034-1900.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0087.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2010/EXP-AVE-2010-0087.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0087.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0086","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2033","title":"Joomla! Percha Multicategory Article 组件 0.6 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Percha Multicategory Article（com_perchacategoriestree）组件 0.6 版本存在目录穿越漏洞。该组件在处理 index.php 的 controller 参数时未对用户输入做充分校验与过滤，远程攻击者可向 index.php 传入包含\"../\"序列的恶意 controller 参数，从而遍历目录结构读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、密码文件等敏感数据），并可能进一步造成其他未明确的安全影响。该漏洞无需身份认证，任何部署了该漏洞组件且未打补丁的 Joomla! 站点均可能遭受信息泄露攻击，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为中高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2033"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-05-25T14:30:01.563","updated":"2026-06-16T23:19:51.297","remediation":"升级 Percha Multicategory Article 到 0.8.0 或更高版本，应用 CVE-2010-2033 安全补丁；禁用不必要的路径验证功能；在 web.config 中配置 security.yrewrite=0 并删除组件目录下的.htaccess 文件；使用 W3AF 或 Joomla Sentinel 工具定期扫描目录遍历漏洞；建立日志记录机制，记录所有 controller 参数访问请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1005-exploits/joomlaperchact-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/39873","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40244","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/34008","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2033.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-2033.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2033.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5df5af06e079a6824349b336150de94d9ba1e7f8/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2033.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-2033-1895.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2010-2033-1897.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f